 ## How the kanji combine
 
-[大](../kanji/大.md) contributes great or principal. 統 contributes uniting or governing, and [領](../kanji/領.md) contributes leading. 大 qualifies the leadership expressed by 統領. The on readings are ダイ + トウ + リョウ. These component associations help remember the title, not determine a country's constitutional powers.
